#. type: Title =
#: en/revolution/modules/rules/pages/shooting-at-a-glance.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Shooting at a Glance"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/revolution/modules/rules/pages/shooting-at-a-glance.adoc:7
msgid "Units shoot once per turn at the closest visible enemy unit."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/revolution/modules/rules/pages/shooting-at-a-glance.adoc:11
msgid "Most missile armed troops can shoot at the enemy up to 30cm away."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/revolution/modules/rules/pages/shooting-at-a-glance.adoc:15
msgid "Total the Attack value for the shooting unit."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/revolution/modules/rules/pages/shooting-at-a-glance.adoc:22
msgid "Roll an Armour save for each hit scored."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/revolution/modules/rules/pages/shooting-at-a-glance.adoc:23
msgid "Record final hits scored."
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ==
#: en/revolution/modules/rules/pages/shooting-at-a-glance.adoc:25
#, no-wrap
msgid "Drive back"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/revolution/modules/rules/pages/shooting-at-a-glance.adoc:29
msgid ""
"Roll a dice for each hit taken, rolling 1 less dice for defended units and 2 "
"less dice for fortified units."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/revolution/modules/rules/pages/shooting-at-a-glance.adoc:30
msgid ""
"Add the dice scores together and drive back the target unit by this distance."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/revolution/modules/rules/pages/shooting-at-a-glance.adoc:31
msgid "If any drive back dice roll 6s, the unit becomes confused."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/revolution/modules/rules/pages/shooting-at-a-glance.adoc:33
msgid ""
"Units driven into enemy units, engaged units or friends who do *not* make "
"way become confused."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/revolution/modules/rules/pages/shooting-at-a-glance.adoc:35
msgid ""
"Units driven into impassable terrain or into friends who *do* make way are "
"confused on the roll of a 6."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/revolution/modules/rules/pages/shooting-at-a-glance.adoc:36
msgid ""
"Friendly units making way for driven back units are confused on the roll of "
"a 6."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/revolution/modules/rules/pages/shooting-at-a-glance.adoc:37
msgid "A unit driven back further than its full pace move is destroyed."
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ==
#: en/revolution/modules/rules/pages/shooting-at-a-glance.adoc:38
#, no-wrap
msgid "Shooting at chargers"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/revolution/modules/rules/pages/shooting-at-a-glance.adoc:41
msgid "Hits inflicted on chargers carry over into the first combat round."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/revolution/modules/rules/pages/shooting-at-a-glance.adoc:42
msgid "Chargers cannot be driven back."
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ==
#: en/revolution/modules/rules/pages/shooting-at-a-glance.adoc:43
#, no-wrap
msgid "Disregard odd hits"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/revolution/modules/rules/pages/shooting-at-a-glance.adoc:45
msgid "At the end of the Shooting phase any odd hits are disregarded."
msgstr ""
